.TH TICKET-MANAGE.PY 1 "2026-10-06" "mu2edaq-controlroom t01.00.00" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
ticket\-manage.py \- PyQt6 window to switch, renew and re\-acquire Kerberos tickets from keytabs (deprecated)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B python3 ticket\-manage.py
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Deprecated.
Superseded by
.BR ticket\-manager (1)
from
.BR mu2edaq\-kerberos ,
which offers the same switch, renew\-one, renew\-all and hourly
auto\-renew, mints new tickets from Vault instead of a keytab on disk, and
runs renewals and Vault fetches on worker threads.
.PP
At start\-up the script prints the OS name, reads
.I kerb_princ.json
(exit 1 if absent), and lists the principal of the default cache and the
principal of every cache in the collection (python\-krb5
.BR cccol_iter ).
The list is not refreshed afterwards.
The window offers:
.TP
.B Switch Tickets
.B kswitch \-p
.IR principal ,
then
.BR "klist \-A" .
.TP
.B Get New Ticket
if the selected principal appears in
.I kerb_princ.json
.BR principal ,
.B kinit \-kt
.IB keypath / keytab\-master
.IR principal ;
otherwise an interactive
.B kinit
.I principal
whose password prompt appears on the launching terminal while the window
blocks.
The per\-principal
.B keytab
entries are read and then ignored in favour of
.BR keytab\-master .
.TP
.BR "Renew Tickets" ", " "File > Renew" " (Ctrl+R), hourly timer"
.B kinit \-R
.I selected\-principal
.TP
.B Renew All Tickets
.B kinit \-R
for each principal listed at start\-up.
.PP
Every action runs
.B kinit
or
.B kswitch
synchronously on the UI thread.
Their exit status is not checked, so failures are not reported.
.SH OPTIONS
None; Qt's own options are accepted.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I kerb_princ.json
searched in the working directory, then beside the script.
Keys:
.B user
(list),
.B principal
(user \-> principal),
.B keytab
(user \-> file),
.B keytab\-master
(one file holding every key),
.B keypath
(directory; shipped as
.IR /Users/anorman/Kerberos_Keytabs/Mu2e ).
.TP
.I ticket\-config.json
same search; loaded if present and otherwise unused.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.B KRB5CCNAME
selects the default cache and collection.
.SH EXIT STATUS
1 if
.I kerb_princ.json
is not found; otherwise Qt's exit status.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
cd mu2edaq\-controlroom && ./bootstrap.sh && venv/bin/pip install PyQt6
venv/bin/python ticket\-manage.py
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ticket\-manager (1),
.BR get\-kerberos\-ticket (1),
